\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls4\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid549190 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid549190\charrsid549190 M\'e9todo Cl\'e1sico:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid549190\charrsid549190 
 El cocinero usa una receta de libro (F\'f3rmula Lambertiana). Si los ingredientes reales (LEDs reales) no saben igual que en el libro, el plato final sabe mal (Error de posici\'f3n).
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid549190\charrsid549190 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid549190\charrsid549190 Tu M\'e9todo (LUT):}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid549190\charrsid549190  El cocinero tiene una nota adhesiva (LUT) pegada en el libro que dice: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid549190\charrsid549190 "Ojo, este ingrediente es m\'e1s picante de lo que dice la receta"}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid549190\charrsid549190 . El cocinero ajusta la cantidad bas\'e1ndose en la nota real mientras cocina. El plato final sale perfecto.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid549190\charrsid549190 
While data-driven approaches like Deep Neural Networks (DNN) have shown remarkable accuracy in VLP, they suffer from poor generalization and high deployment costs. A DNN implicitly learns the specific room geometry, requiring extensive in-situ data collec
tion and retraining for any change in the environment setup. In contrast, our proposed LUT-based estimator preserves the physics-based model structure. This ensures that the system remains modular: the radiometric characterization of the LED (contained in
 the LUT) is decoupled from the geometric layout, allowing for 'plug-and-play' deployment without the need for labor-intensive site surveys or retraining, while maintaining low computational complexity suitable for embedded receivers.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
